     1107        VIEW-AS FILL-IN
     1108        SIZE 40 BY 1 NO-UNDO.
     1109   DEFINE VARIABLE v-prefix AS CHARACTER FORMAT "X(256)":U INITIAL "639300,275"
     1110        LABEL "Префикс для карт Малина"
     1111        VIEW-AS FILL-IN
     1112        SIZE 42.5 BY 1 NO-UNDO.
