     1117   "По объектам", 2
     1118        SIZE 17 BY 2.13 NO-UNDO.
     1119   DEFINE RECTANGLE RECT-2
     1120        EDGE-PIXELS 2 GRAPHIC-EDGE  NO-FILL
     1121        SIZE 26.5 BY 3.75.
